WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.170
The Earth has a skin,

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:07.570
and that skin is plagued 
by many different things.

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:09.980
One of those plagues is humanity itself.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.560
We are that which cures the 
Earth of its plagues.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:14.400
We are the Council of the Seven Virtues.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:17.160
Born from the plague, but not of the plague.

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:20.690
Number Zero.

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:23.040
Hatate Souta.

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:25.240
A heretic that can perceive the flags,

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:27.790
and control fate with his own hands.

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:30.660
We must assess this heretic.

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:34.480
Is he a true messenger of the Sacraments,

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:36.300
or will he bring harm to this world?

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:38.750
This will be dangerous.

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:42.340
Man is a rope—a rope over an abyss.

00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:44.900
A dangerous across, a dangerous on-the-way,

00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:48.770
a dangerous looking-back, 
a dangerous shuddering and stopping.

00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:50.730
And I think he

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:53.710
represents the rope we see before us.

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:02.950
My name is Daimyouzamurai Mei.

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:04.890
Nice to meet you all.

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:17.270
<b>If Her Flag Breaks</b>

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:41.010
<b>Flag 6</b>

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:41.010
<b>Phew. Don't Scare Me Like That. I Guess You're Just a Little Sister.</b>

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:41.010
{titles}

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:45.780
Just ask me if you need anything.

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:47.930
If you have any boy trouble, 
I'll be glad to help.

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:51.100
I'm not interested in the opposite sex.

00:02:52.040 --> 00:02:54.180
Yuri?!

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:56.270
You want to get some crêpes on the way back?

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:57.790
I'll buy.

00:02:57.790 --> 00:03:00.530
I gain weight every time I eat too much.

00:03:01.100 --> 00:03:02.200
My boobs, anyway.

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:05.880
The world's so unfair!

00:03:05.880 --> 00:03:07.860
<i>A person with the same power as me...</i>

00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:09.400
<i>Who is this girl?</i>

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:13.130
You just sighed looking at someone. 
Who was it, Sou-kun?

00:03:13.510 --> 00:03:14.940
My name was on the list.

00:03:14.940 --> 00:03:17.650
I'm going to the forest with you!

00:03:17.650 --> 00:03:20.910
I get to go on the ocean trip with Souta-kun!

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:21.550
Huh?

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:22.800
Wait a second.

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:24.190
What's going on...

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:26.510
<b>Ocean Field Trip</b>

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:26.510
<b>Forest Field Trip</b>

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:26.510
<b>Hatate Souta</b>

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:26.510
<b>Hatate Souta</b>

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:28.970
Why is my name on both lists?

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:31.160
Would you like me to clear that up for you?

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:32.340
Yes or no?

00:03:32.340 --> 00:03:33.910
Yes, I guess.

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:38.580
<i>Sorry about that, Hatate-kun.</i>

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:41.590
<i>We normally would have 
you go on the ocean trip</i>

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:43.790
<i>since your swimming grades are bad,</i>

00:03:43.790 --> 00:03:45.540
<i>but Eiyuuzaki-kun threatened me...</i>

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:47.090
<i>I mean, asked me to do something.</i>

00:03:47.090 --> 00:03:49.300
<i>So I put you on the ocean trip 
during the first half of the trip,</i>

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:51.960
<i>and the forest trip for the second half.</i>

00:03:52.220 --> 00:03:54.320
That doesn't really sound like...

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:56.330
<i>You get to see the ocean and the mountains,</i>

00:03:56.330 --> 00:03:59.890
<i>and you get to have fun with 
everyone from Quest Dorm easily.</i>

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:00.610
<i>Sweet, huh?</i>

00:04:00.610 --> 00:04:03.260
<i>Oh, yeah, how about going on a date with me,</i>

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:05.010
<i>while you're at it--</i>

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:07.990
That sounds like a good time, then.

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:11.180
Yes, everyone in Quest Dorm gets 
to spend half their time with you.

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:13.060
Sou-kun, Sou-kun,

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:16.460
if you ever get lonely, just come to my room.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:18.190
H-Huh?

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:22.660
I get the feeling there was just a 
"this is going to be trouble" flag.

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:28.740
Non non!

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:30.670
Non non!

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:35.730
Yay...

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:41.310
The beach, huh?

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:49.120
The beach!

00:04:49.120 --> 00:04:50.510
Great. Now we're here.

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:52.520
Let's go!

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:57.170
After hiking you've got 
make-up lessons, Akane-chan.

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:59.840
We're going to get you into 
shape on those mountains.

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:02.590
Beach!

00:05:02.890 --> 00:05:05.150
Souta-kun!

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:06.370
You kind of feel bad for Akane-chan.

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:07.680
Don't worry about it.

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:09.700
We'll be lodging in the same place.

00:05:14.400 --> 00:05:15.940
So this is the ocean?!

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:18.210
This is your first time seeing the ocean?

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:21.100
Yeah, my country is surrounded by land.

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:23.430
Anyway, you should come in, too!

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:24.210
Sure.

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:26.870
It feels good on my feet!

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:29.090
You won't rust if you get in 
the water, will you, Ruri?

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:33.240
I have special waterproof coating,

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:34.530
so I should be fine.

00:05:35.470 --> 00:05:39.190
Souta, don't just stand there. Join us.

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:40.760
R-Right...

00:05:41.060 --> 00:05:44.280
I'm surprised you can't swim though, Megu.

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:46.520
You were great at track.

00:05:46.520 --> 00:05:49.660
I didn't do any swimming at all...

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:50.450
Why?

00:05:50.890 --> 00:05:53.950
Y-You know boy swimsuits

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:56.210
only have bottoms...

00:05:57.540 --> 00:06:00.710
But I don't mind now because...

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:09.090
Wh-Why'd you poke me in the eyes?!

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:11.800
I guess I shouldn't have... Sorry.

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:15.800
They have boy swimsuits with a top now!

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:17.980
Tee-hee.

00:06:18.490 --> 00:06:20.230
Uh, right.

00:06:20.460 --> 00:06:22.940
Why can't you swim, Souta-kun?

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:25.320
I-I...

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:28.360
So this is where you guys have been...

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:30.960
Big!

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:32.710
Wh-What's wrong?

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:35.040
Who knew you had such big boobs...

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:38.570
Girls with bigger boobs look 
good in kimonos, don't they?

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:40.830
She was wearing a uniform, though.

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:42.830
Well, whatever.

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:45.140
Go for a swim.

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:50.830
Barf, barf, barf.

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:52.930
That's gross!

00:06:58.920 --> 00:07:01.790
Are you okay, Souta-kun?

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:03.880
Do you not feel well?

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:06.780
I can't handle getting 
too close to the ocean.

00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:08.400
It all comes back to me...

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:11.320
The Premium Ambriel, correct?

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:13.470
Yeah.

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:15.750
What's that about?

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:17.600
You don't know, Granny?

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:18.580
Souta-kun...

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:22.500
He saw all of the destruction and despair.

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:32.180
I didn't know you had such a tough time...

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:35.430
You must have had it rough, Souta-kun.

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:43.060
I'll help you learn to swim, Souta.

00:07:43.570 --> 00:07:45.030
Like a grandma taking care of her grandson.

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:46.920
Yeah.

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:50.410
Ruri, watch after little 
Nanami and little Megumu.

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:52.570
I'll take care of little Souta, here.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:01.460
Come to me.

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:03.460
R-Right.

00:08:03.780 --> 00:08:07.400
Just think of it as a giant puddle.

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:09.220
Come on.

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:13.060
Barf, barf.

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:14.080
Are you okay?

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:16.120
Sorry for making a mess...

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:17.910
It's fine.

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:19.640
Want to take a break?

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:23.810
Yeah... I think I'll do that, Granny.

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:31.620
Here you go.

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:32.240
Huh?

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:36.070
Oh, thanks.

00:08:40.460 --> 00:08:42.190
This doesn't taste like anything!

00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:43.330
What's in here?!

00:08:43.850 --> 00:08:46.040
I got some milk and put enough water into it

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:48.170
until it looked like your 
average sports drink.

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:53.880
Would you like a popsicle for 
100 yen to go along with that?

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:55.010
You were trying to sell me things?!

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:57.320
Oh, I didn't really...

00:08:57.320 --> 00:08:59.760
I gave that to you because 
I thought you needed it.

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:02.430
You don't have to buy anything.

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:06.440
I'll take one.

00:09:06.760 --> 00:09:09.450
You're a nice guy.

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:15.570
<i>She'll move the story to the next stage...</i>

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:17.740
<i>It's a story flag.</i>

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:19.650
Is something wrong?

00:09:19.650 --> 00:09:20.830
Oh, sorry.

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:22.140
Here's the 100 yen.

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:24.080
Thanks.

00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:30.100
You're here on a field trip?

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:31.510
Y-Yeah.

00:09:31.510 --> 00:09:33.300
My name's Hatate Souta.

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:35.420
I'm Daishikyougawa Kurumiko.

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:36.880
Daishikyougawa (Bishop)?!

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:40.800
Are you sure you're not getting heat stroke?

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:42.370
No, I'm fine.

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:44.420
Is this your job?

00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:45.890
Are you always around here?

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:47.070
I...

00:09:48.140 --> 00:09:49.190
You in middle school?

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:52.350
S-Something like that.

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:55.680
I-I'll see you later.

00:09:55.680 --> 00:09:57.530
Please buy something again.

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:17.180
Kikuno-senpai and Rin-chan-senpai,

00:10:17.180 --> 00:10:20.770
keep whispering this chant every 
time they get close to me.

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:23.370
Don't make people get the wrong idea.

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:26.640
We just told you the formulas 
you needed to know.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:29.030
I'm terrible with numbers.

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:32.530
I was wondering why you got assigned to the

00:10:32.530 --> 00:10:34.810
forest trip when your grades were so good...

00:10:34.810 --> 00:10:37.080
Sou-kun, were you able to swim again?

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:38.220
I...

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:42.420
That's terrible!

00:10:42.420 --> 00:10:44.940
You've been through so much...

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:48.450
How long do you have to keep 
going through all of this?

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:49.580
Akane...

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:52.660
You're such a good girl,

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:54.960
crying for little Souta over here.

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:58.410
I'd love for you two to have a kid and

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:01.090
show me a cute grandson.

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:04.910
No! No!

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:06.820
I'm sure Nanami-chan and Megu-chan

00:11:06.820 --> 00:11:09.310
would make a cuter child!

00:11:09.530 --> 00:11:11.060
Why me?!

00:11:11.610 --> 00:11:14.320
Not sure I can help there...

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:18.860
Actually, how old are you really, anyway?

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:21.700
It's rude to worry about a woman's age.

00:11:22.210 --> 00:11:26.030
Yeah, but I'm kind of curious to know 
if you've always looked so young.

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:28.450
Well, if you want to know...

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:30.620
Take a look.

00:11:35.650 --> 00:11:36.540
Who's that?

00:11:36.540 --> 00:11:39.070
You shrink when you get older.

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:40.670
No... No... No... No...

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:45.260
A few decades and you'll look like me.

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:46.630
Seriously?!

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:51.060
Okay, everyone!

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:53.450
We're about to reach the halfway point for

00:11:53.450 --> 00:11:55.480
both the forest trip and the ocean trip.

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:58.520
I can finally get away from the ocean.

00:11:58.520 --> 00:12:01.150
So tomorrow, as a change of pace,

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:03.770
we'll have the guy and girls

00:12:03.770 --> 00:12:06.150
from the forest trip go to the ocean,

00:12:06.150 --> 00:12:08.080
and vice-versa.

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:08.940
Huh?

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:11.460
The beach!

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:13.910
The beach is nice.

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:17.000
Yeah, it really feels like summer.

00:12:17.300 --> 00:12:18.090
I've been had.

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:22.400
Souta-kun! It's the beach! The beach!

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:24.510
Yeah, I guess it is.

00:12:24.510 --> 00:12:26.440
Let's go. It's the beach!

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:28.680
Wai—

00:12:30.040 --> 00:12:32.730
Barf! Barf! Barf!

00:12:36.850 --> 00:12:38.620
I'm fine.

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:40.730
You guys have fun.

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:41.940
But...

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:45.180
I can't go and have fun

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:48.430
all by myself without you!

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:49.410
Yahoo!

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:50.600
That was fast.

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:51.870
You just left him there!

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:53.680
That's fine.

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:57.130
I'd feel worse if you guys just sat here 
worrying about me instead of having fun.

00:12:57.440 --> 00:12:58.610
Sou-kun...

00:12:58.910 --> 00:13:02.020
I'll go and have fun.

00:13:02.470 --> 00:13:04.130
Let's go, Rin-chan.

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:06.820
If Souta insists...

00:13:09.360 --> 00:13:12.970
You're not going to go 
swimming today, either, huh?

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:13.720
Nope.

00:13:13.720 --> 00:13:15.160
The water's too much.

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:20.020
You must be working pretty hard every day.

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:21.760
If I don't work hard,

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:25.130
my parents in heaven won't be able to relax.

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:27.660
Kurumiko...

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:31.130
I-I have new products today.

00:13:31.130 --> 00:13:33.210
I can put these on your tab.

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:38.920
My mom and dad always said that...

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:43.720
I shouldn't depend on other 
people and remember that

00:13:43.720 --> 00:13:45.610
I need to get by on my own.

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:47.380
That's why I'm all right.

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:50.140
You're strong, Kurumiko.

00:13:52.110 --> 00:13:54.560
That's not true.

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:56.400
Souta-kun!

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:57.710
It's a sea cucumber!

00:13:58.550 --> 00:14:00.330
It's so slimy!

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:04.230
You're always with a 
different girl, aren't you?

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:06.320
Yeah, I guess so.

00:14:08.270 --> 00:14:10.130
I finally got it out.

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:12.200
Hm? Who's this?

00:14:12.570 --> 00:14:13.710
She's my friend.

00:14:14.010 --> 00:14:15.770
Daishikyougawa Kurumiko.

00:14:16.070 --> 00:14:18.290
I sell popsicles.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:22.210
Oh, if you're Souta-kun's 
friend, then you're my friend!

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:24.210
Let me buy all of your stock.

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:27.270
Thank you for getting everything.

00:14:29.330 --> 00:14:30.590
Here you go.

00:14:30.590 --> 00:14:33.320
What a flashy person.

00:14:33.320 --> 00:14:36.100
Well, she was born into a rich family.

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:38.350
Rich... family.

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:41.770
Do you like selling popsicles?

00:14:42.530 --> 00:14:44.670
No,

00:14:44.670 --> 00:14:47.030
I'm just trying to make enough 
to live and go to school.

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:49.910
I guess you're working to 
put yourself through school.

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:52.550
Thank you.

00:14:58.380 --> 00:15:00.040
I-I...

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:00.720
Akane,

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:04.600
it'll be fine.

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:06.950
Yeah.

00:15:14.110 --> 00:15:15.880
Sorry...

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:17.400
When I thought about how 
there could be someone there

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:19.610
that could just buy all of 
my stuff just like that,

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:23.060
I didn't think I belonged.

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:25.530
I don't think you need to be embarrassed.

00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:27.990
Struggling to be alive, to look 
at becoming something more,

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:30.750
that's something that only humans can do.

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:32.570
It's precious.

00:15:33.210 --> 00:15:36.580
No one has a right to laugh 
at someone like that.

00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:39.120
You're a nice person.

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:42.330
I'm sure that girl means a lot to you.

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:46.150
Akane's such a good person.

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:48.380
Her name's Akane...

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:50.830
I should apologize to 
her next time I see her.

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:54.720
I should apologize to you and thank you, too.

00:15:57.220 --> 00:16:01.230
<i>The story flag has progressed 
to the next stage.</i>

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:04.100
I'll do something special.

00:16:20.590 --> 00:16:22.040
What's this?

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:23.490
Whenever I'm having a hard time,

00:16:23.490 --> 00:16:27.250
I come here and remember 
what my parents told me.

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:31.140
"You shouldn't depend on other 
people and remember that

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:33.140
you need to get by on your own," huh?

00:16:33.560 --> 00:16:36.030
That's what I thought, too, but...

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:40.390
It isn't that bad to depend 
on others, you know?

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:46.270
There's something I couldn't tell you...

00:16:47.490 --> 00:16:49.940
When I first gave you that drink,

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:52.630
I knew who you were, that's why I did it.

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:53.900
You knew who I was?

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:55.450
Why would you...

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:56.870
Could you...

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:59.180
My parents were crew on

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:02.750
the Premium Ambriel.

00:17:04.110 --> 00:17:06.750
So you hated me because of that and...

00:17:07.120 --> 00:17:08.500
No!

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:11.510
You should hate me instead.

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:15.240
It was the duty of the staff to 
make sure everyone was safe, and...

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:19.030
The TV and newspapers made 
it all sound like your fault.

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:21.770
That was wrong.

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:24.380
So when you said you weren't 
going to depend on anyone,

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:26.900
you wanted to carry that burden,

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:29.320
that cross in the stead of your parents?

00:17:30.350 --> 00:17:33.750
Everything's been so hard every day.

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:37.280
I wanted to give up on everything.

00:17:38.170 --> 00:17:42.170
And that's when I saw you.

00:17:43.860 --> 00:17:45.910
I'm not the only one in pain.

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:49.750
It's embarrassing I thought that.

00:17:50.050 --> 00:17:52.390
I'm sure you won't forgive me for

00:17:52.390 --> 00:17:54.530
trying to seek help from you...

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:57.340
I forgive you.

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:00.950
There was no reason

00:18:01.250 --> 00:18:04.270
for you to carry that cross.

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:08.270
You're really nice.

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:12.190
No way.

00:18:12.700 --> 00:18:13.980
Onii-san?

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:16.700
The tide

00:18:17.470 --> 00:18:18.490
came in?

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:27.960
I'm sorry.

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:30.690
If I hadn't brought you here...

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:31.810
It's fine.

00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:33.380
Don't blame yourself so much.

00:18:33.680 --> 00:18:36.630
If I had a brother like you,

00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:38.130
I'm sure I would

00:18:38.130 --> 00:18:41.500
have been a lot happier.

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:43.060
Same here.

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:45.540
If I had a nice sister like you,

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:47.430
I'm sure everything would be different now.

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:48.680
Um...

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:51.940
Is it all right if I ask you something?

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:53.150
<i>Is this...</i>

00:18:53.910 --> 00:18:56.680
If we're able to get out of here safely,

00:18:56.980 --> 00:18:59.000
would you promise we'll become

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:01.730
brother and sister in spirit?

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:05.870
<i>Death flags...</i>

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:07.570
<i>I need to get rid of those...</i>

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:09.290
<i>I'll tell her no...</i>

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:13.980
<i>Wait... No, I don't know 
why, but that's not it.</i>

00:19:13.980 --> 00:19:15.130
<i>I don't need to tell her no.</i>

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:16.420
Kurumiko,

00:19:16.980 --> 00:19:19.490
let's become real brothers and sisters,

00:19:19.490 --> 00:19:21.020
not something "in spirit."

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:24.680
Onii-san?

00:19:30.800 --> 00:19:32.940
<i>Is this the power of the story flag?</i>

00:19:33.620 --> 00:19:35.600
Yes.

00:19:35.600 --> 00:19:39.600
I'll do my best to be your sister.

00:19:40.170 --> 00:19:42.200
I don't have to worry about anything

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:44.950
having a nice brother like you.

00:19:45.390 --> 00:19:49.130
I'm happy with just you as my brother.

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:51.210
<i>Why are they coming up like that?!</i>

00:19:51.790 --> 00:19:52.960
<i>Fine...</i>

00:19:53.470 --> 00:19:55.460
Come with me to Hatagaya Academy!

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:56.340
Huh?

00:19:56.740 --> 00:19:59.030
There's a middle school dorm there!

00:19:59.030 --> 00:20:00.970
I'm sure we can do something 
about the tuition!

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:03.080
Also...

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:05.220
everyone there helped me.

00:20:06.730 --> 00:20:09.650
I want to help you this time.

00:20:10.350 --> 00:20:13.070
I guess you might not want to go, but...

00:20:14.140 --> 00:20:17.010
No, that's not true.

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:20.490
Huh?

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:24.740
Wh-What's that?

00:20:33.100 --> 00:20:33.670
Huh?

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:38.300
Mimori-san told me that it would be 
good to surprise people like this,

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:39.530
so I gave it a try.

00:20:39.530 --> 00:20:40.920
Don't do stuff like that!

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:43.040
Someone came to save us?

00:20:43.040 --> 00:20:47.030
Or should we be saving her instead?

00:20:47.030 --> 00:20:49.130
I think she's

00:20:49.130 --> 00:20:51.680
beyond our help.

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:53.550
This is Ruri.

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:55.310
I've found Souta-san.

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:57.010
<i>I'm so glad...</i>

00:20:57.010 --> 00:20:59.330
<i>I was so worried when I</i>

00:20:59.330 --> 00:21:01.110
<i>found out he was missing...</i>

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:03.320
Would you like me to rescue you?

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:04.490
Yes or no?

00:21:05.040 --> 00:21:06.060
Yes.

00:21:11.760 --> 00:21:15.600
Is it really okay for me to go with you?

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:18.370
Yeah, I have to introduce 
you to everyone, though.

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:20.370
Yeah.

00:23:11.180 --> 00:23:12.570
Roar! Gawo!

00:23:12.570 --> 00:23:15.460
Do you two know each other?

00:23:15.460 --> 00:23:17.500
You noticed?

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:21.970
It's kind of like friends of friends 
just kind of sat down with you,

00:23:21.970 --> 00:23:24.420
and it's kind of awkward.

00:23:24.420 --> 00:23:28.610
W-Well, I guess you'll have to 
watch the next episode to see.

00:23:28.610 --> 00:23:33.040
I guess we just had the "you did 
a good job on the preview" flag.

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>Flag 7</b>

00:23:30.970 --> 00:23:35.010
<b>I Learned Something Amazing. I'll Hide Myself Before I can be Erased</b>

00:23:33.040 --> 00:23:34.600
Roar! Gawo!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>If Her Flag Breaks</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Watch it with your big sis next time!</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Illustration: Niwa
